{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 668,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:799e5804884919c303546b30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "既然被那样子看待的话，我就更应该\\n成为大家所期待的「光芒」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb2b91911c67d4d9a19d2893d1d055360d466e6c0b8db14b1e1cac7696662e61",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "353"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c17531e29825f4c63c9f3506",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对，我很高兴！大概是因为我从小开始，\\n就听着父亲的歌长大的缘故吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e4fff037b097f676f90861e850f862d66cfae766973a57bc3ce6cfd0b7e73d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "354"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c00a4eb6183e20ac1f22541",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "怒涛那融入感情和有着精湛转音的歌声……\\n啊，很抱歉我不是在讲竞赛的事情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "501d1bf9bd1219326823b3f56a0c876a23fae7865f82b7ea313eecaae28c8c7c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "355"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62a2fe09ea0d46d833a8b91",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有一点……但紧张时只要回想起以前和小钻\\n一起奔跑的事情，就会冷静下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea5b0c559139b931a8020a928468ea6e1f1f7dcce43dcf3a2e6613661ee3cb6b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "356"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:555d4806baf0933382471284",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢！感觉我距离自己所向往的\\n背影又更近一步了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f787c32cde50ec900e122d9d0459443976eae4185bee60035b88eff1bd07bee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "357"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66032f2f5ba35f2c634923ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我把在这场竞赛中发现到的事情写下来了！\\n是想要在决赛前克服的问题点……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06874c8b63bbaf2340cad750ef0fd0dab1604941edc6681ee16d043efef5cc5d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "358"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aaec99bd993fe6e5b82e4ee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有、有的……但因为「进入闸门后就是\\n武藏与小次郎」！不论是谁我都会全力以赴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e80acb27d6cf6447220c2b840d4ee87858adf564e5b616cd5ea68b4d059d4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "359"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8215a8a8f28d238ce3391fa1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与母亲不相上下是指要成为\\n「在竞赛史上留名的赛马娘」。我还差得远。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa4058934fc94f3bf4519965e8b2e0157b0e5f3bcd596b9f5dd820d853e50214",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "36"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab54d3efb9236a76f19c6f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "乳清蛋白。青花菜。菲力牛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "175ada32ccb2738aeb57c978378f33481d9d90358559a657f843cf6b599466da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "360"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ba96b026eb327de685b3a64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，小狗。比赛时也会紧跟过来，\\n是个听话的好孩子喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f054edd1f24f59dd021638d61081b8c09e45540d80ef2ff2f4aa770181dbf62b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b39fb16412ddbe074701a770",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这种问题的答案只有一个吧。\\n闪耀的一等星……看着我就够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b4c4d31a537b13874feb3ea72a740829c3f99659c0e25e0783020ccf6df8aac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "362"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:998762b721c782e235eb33c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我下场比赛的目标也是要用尽全力\\n在大家心中留下印象。还请看着我的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93cbc2dd5f2977e598021195d9bfc3cf76b9caf5f1e3c1cd5312a417ec6cb460",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "363"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f82346b95c23921c5f8cf28",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我跑得相当舒服……\\n对我来说，没有比这更值得感到喜悦的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e6a8b01578dbb1ba1c6a6754071d7b430afe7eae8c14d87ed7efd34847d30b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "364"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d1f63593dcf2f4d350e462c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我一定会赌上自己的一切，\\n持续跑到决赛为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00092ebd2f7851859e4c84981b4c5b8c192a686b783b198596edca43d69d3263",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "365"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2644daceb1dcba4371fef93",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "无论有多想努力锻炼，若没有人给予指引\\n便会误入歧途。而你正是我的路标！",
      "source_fingerprint": "730d9c8eac5111e09f383b087985ec66c3f8d50be8304172233f665e710efe26",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "366"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48bdd65f392b4ad5ce77da9c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我从现在起要去将八重垣流的强悍之处和精神\\n传达到竞赛的世界！请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fd14ec2cc1058881d21c6491167efe448022a4c71a2131c9b25a34dda50ef17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "367"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c44012183188705769473218",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "卸下一切的伪装，拿出自己的一切互相较劲。\\n这恰恰等同于以真本事交锋的对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06ee65043002bd292ec05f109471bd733fd3385e7d33df38657693ff3733c618",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "368"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3d45ca3dfb8ae3f1ed27917",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦？啊，我满脸都是笑容吗……！？\\n真不好意思！我以后会注意的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e97909461ed589f7c1127355d321f5f89e8384ed0af1b4cb72458bf3540468",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "37"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c27114c03911b0d5ae88d59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就只能去累积能超越她们的修练成果了呢～\\n正所谓「没有能战胜努力的天赋」。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80c677cc22508f59eea059f0a41a4a6c2318a98b625c0bacaa061347e7e13594",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "372"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1e4a5f5e6e41b7a161b8d01",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀！若能与我敬爱的姐姐们在荣耀的舞台上\\n互相较劲，那真的是很幸运呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d484cad70c57db39c6f8be302cb3a43673168f22cd44c6e44ba51d2c7937152",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "373"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:446236e1eddbc4bd6e80730f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呵呵呵，训练员有特别叮嘱我\\n要对这一类的提问保密了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2c57e1b2666d35a74c650ebba697b201fe1a8ba873bdc4a0addc0c6e024f414",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "374"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ef57d240f537338b7c90c2d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "其实他们有一起在线观看我的比赛喔！\\n而且大大地称赞了我一番呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37f35bfb883db9eaa737ff5c85c14dd3fb0922fb2ec313736d68aedea8bb3af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "378"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb882bf6846a92eb3d2a648",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "获胜的话会有「爆进式的庆功宴」\\n在等着我……所以今天暂时先保留♪　",
      "source_fingerprint": "a854777072887d0b33794ab488073d23c1a097099ca8ec474e620c9e4dfccbe8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "379"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4398e96ba7ca617432769fe5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在想连一秒也不能错过大家的英姿……\\n啊，在尽我最大的努力关注对手的行动！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d259099b2c0a3643b88dea101833a49c33b12b701d084bb3b970b86827a8d49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "38"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5152e077972301ec4a677f33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢大家一直以来支持着身为花蕾的我，\\n并见证了我绽放的瞬间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c7c449685e5e43c601f029e633c6b0040803057498ebee28ac0e62a300b6b29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "380"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07d007ec6b410b40f4117340",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想决赛时要面对的挑战会变得更加严峻！\\n但我会加油的，还请大家声援我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "167680e523683ea98bffa6829727bcebdf99b39ecdf3df664312684e34116141",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "381"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b36e79d673516dd074b0e7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我知道大家都很强！\\n正因如此我才想要超越大家……我会超越的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d26c7cddeac4bc52053097e9ee23c9ef13fadf95cf9cd663a7238a5fb160207b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "382"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3fc1d5bc2a8ce01153cd05a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练我全都拼命做了，要说哪个比较特别……\\n啊，我等一下去问问看训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8d0e665fcc83da01561099b7b811fb287c2bf3d6e8060248a3ed804dbfb0a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "383"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:515b87b2e03709c0375a6365",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呃，是场让我跑得很开心的竞赛。\\n赛场的风很舒服，景色也很漂亮……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fa292b8648313ed6f9b0a6e5519af8992831954a2e418cf56136f4db6a6191d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "384"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1c9ecb9d0ac1c0b4b04dd7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要说作战……其实就跟平常一样，\\n总之不把前头让给任何人，尽力向前跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a2f9e68cba489ce3b59dc87ea9fbca6ae02de15d1618c66471342ba6dbb4ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "385"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1952168e87e206b1c3c110be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我看到了令人想就那样不断跑下去……\\n既新奇又亮眼的景色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45905bf071364d583207bb63c38e480c4e24fed2e92706a438f38273fbe7cd99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "386"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f26e24fc14d54dbfeea7a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然是让其他人全都相形失色的……\\n没事！会长在瞪我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "270e204e99cb67ed9dc1858ea7d609d62ca2cf91a2dfbf7d5e01fb3e5fd941ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "387"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df7266152cabf2904905c69e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没错，这只不过是其中的一页！\\n这位记者说得很好～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b1042e0956ad510e4455e3797197deee702b18031ebaea1915189dae0d68e0b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "388"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17b1f86f141d7208eb97ca26",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我要赢过在场所有的赛马娘，\\n证明能拿下优胜的「绝对会是我」喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc57e54dd4aca2bf32012609b4808ce0b77a4dc6f2ea84c46d7893b4b373ab9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "389"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a02d5f3e44de19ebfb88b7e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "咦～可以去期待其他选手吗？\\n这样才值得我去背叛你的那份期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b82bf0aec23901c4d5590bb9ea381d94a7fd77470e1c3882c09db7dd113877c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "39"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe3d240f769360d9f9377e0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好耀眼！努力不懈的小妹妹们都好可爱，\\n让姐姐我感到很温馨呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcb7a55352268769ae842d80016583650794ea1f28e487dab0a45dbc3fa2d8fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "390"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33f5e722135cdb4c2069586e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是「泡沫乐园」♪只要有买年票的话，\\n就随时都能在度假村里狂欢啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a56a7f5b47fbc4a16c2d51e198154d4beeef789c460cc2256fed74de97195915",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "391"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abc55a707986bd056bdcf75b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是玩一款叫「胡萝卜吉」的养成游戏喔♪\\n我已经被泡沫吉给迷得神魂颠倒了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23c4b25710998bdbc99b6471b52589af58615f73415670a57aebdbc88e93f3a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "392"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0afe82b66c6ca7bcec6e4d00",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谁知道呢？如果你只一直注视着我的话，\\n或许就会知道啰……开玩笑的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bad7a161d845f883fef2bb8f2b5e2d753fb963a85b83c72cdf8ae971bf9a54d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "393"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d3545aa023f76f3753be384",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "来约定吧！我下次也会用自己的表现\\n来让大家见证「奇迹」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "455c6a3d2a5019c4f49f36e0629d315fa3566ed79246855faff82e1c0e0fd1ad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "394"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29bad3f868c15aecd9de2df5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "谢谢！能让你们像这样用闪闪发亮的眼睛\\n看着我，对我而言就是最大的鼓励喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d87072a879008054ca9c155f58113e67b2a1f86e3873d0b55161cb79c739e7fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "395"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e45d581f015c8680ba30cdb9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "「吃得饱饱的」……这好像跟平时没两样……\\n到下次比赛前，先让我想一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02203931f5e2e6e67a6e344e7c77348baebfad1ce877d9ad6ea3ee4e836ea029",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "396"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94b6047f8b3d340abb8e2807",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我自己是不太清楚……但我跑步时的表情\\n难道真的那么恐怖吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5b7c7a36321f6eea952ea33476bfcf78de8b797d42b90c3c4f5e2c38f82daee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "397"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af5ef4d868726248b72136d9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大家的声援总是能给我许多帮助……\\n希望大家今后也能一直看着我的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "096107e5ed0a8e0f1b56cec923c866fbc21a992aa490f07a8b5d844474013732",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "398"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f870f5845c20f2c629c12f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "海鳗……不对，是虎鲸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "560a312c6b949572e17485b3662fc7d8e530f9b59c72ca141a35dc33efac4d8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "399"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee3856681d4d2f4538cf9be9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "这个嘛……啊，我有想说等竞赛一结束，\\n就要穿上新的运动鞋外出。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c58ccd8a0cb480663c9749f85c2f1413e1edb83ffd2253da67c1d4b4b1ca53b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f18618e48f67318f9e2da072",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "讨厌啦～把作战讲出来的话，下次比赛的时候\\n不就会被提防了吗？真是的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ceac6c50983383c75608e9040c7d648d375f751682c454f6427737fdd04d00c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "40"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d52871a6a8e11d30507ef9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我为了要在训练员脸上乱涂鸦，就把\\n墨水换成了墨汁啰。应该是因为这样吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c526cd60a3bdd0976a1ced052d297a62c310f00a87d08b4daadff3bcd514eac1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "400"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbec7c124ee6f19b7c832b8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那家伙马上就塞了一堆训练过来。\\n应该要一边看着棋谱一边进行五组PK赛才对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83eec9633d3b6585425b7498d7e979c849664e52de41a3333c68e1d03f137f03",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "401"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:086329f804d38b1cd431ea99",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "虽然我很想说……竞赛对我而言全都一样，\\n但还是……唔唔～我要加油──！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4bc7cdff39e28257b6791a0b148904b4cd492f7cf619379c22b1f8813845b7d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "402"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3d94b16c685ce7d19117c85",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "因为我一直都很────拼命地去比赛，\\n所以根本就没时间去觉得辛苦呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35652432399ae4c4ade49447dfad56ebf4be22767aea04d9732169c75c320f86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "403"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c679fd53a4f55ad3483c6c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是还没有啦……但感觉之后应该会郑重地\\n来跟我说一些……让人感到害臊的话吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1519203fb951e49b04efeb376d220752aba247aebb26f5aae507e88d7210cab3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "404"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f46ba02ac407c24b8cce0607",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很荣幸能与那样的对手们较劲。\\n我会抱着虚心求教的态度下场比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fdf4ad8f83e84ac8bed2eaa029c79db7881a5b11daabc7cf152b796ab3e50a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "405"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4d429421bca06183bc11306",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在小地方发生了明显的失误……\\n不过，我一定会在决赛之前改进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ae9670591b59a42f2e969f29d9dae7245b6a7aad3a432afd3395c568569343",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "406"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c3305c96ec0aa7434eff797",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "原本想尝试看看脚步轻盈的跑法，但最后\\n还是决定采用力道强劲的风格去比赛了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "250ff92e7fcc49a338b332010e2cb0db3a231d8fe7a6dfe4734547bfd2a1a230",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "407"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3dabede6726f8f00227c713c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "各位有享受到美式规格的竞赛了吗？\\n我在决赛时会拿出世界级的表现喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca1fe40538a0402dee2066ff3551bfab79fb21afe2d9946164a8d5a084c07e7c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "408"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb8beed8457603e90c6148d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Good harvest！\\n现在的我感觉能在各种竞赛中获胜喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "682d030ff3c6a9b649087dbda1f11be7aa28d75ccb4f55dcda9014f7767261ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "409"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ad0b7e559189519dd3bc989",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没错吧？快到看不见对不对？\\n这就是所谓的光速啦！哇哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4933a1995d58170bc40696fd102796268da50b9a9601a2fc3cc3f73d2e089c17",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "41"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d32958cd1ed6e94b1b7d7ba7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员正在模拟竞赛时的情况！\\n我要做的只有相信他而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bfe9944fa34e74ff8dce30b407e007e4acedcf5b2399e516764bf0ba85a97e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "410"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfcbe098b12779dcb83f5c8c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竭尽全力与强敌激烈竞争的兴奋感，\\n实在是无可取代呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "95e125515d1b618a7884a6a933843fec883c798db266d567614cd6ff1770040d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f606923f693c3acbd17d886",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是要先把手机桌布上的目标竞赛日期\\n换成决赛的日期吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8828d1a87ac6cb3ae99ec15b1e3c91e3e2644af6e87a51610b9d89982bbaeed1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "412"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20cb44ba3ae51dedec3830cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "俗话说「胜不骄，败不馁」。\\n我想继续精进自己，不会让自己松懈下来喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "001f21bb06e4817b3c07363478d1ac204c575de5b5ff45d418e5c505f6523e26",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "413"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:701d11bc4eb441a14be9615c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正合我意！不这样的话比赛就不有趣了！\\n不论对手是谁我都要用单挑一较高下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bb9c52fbc28d64d75386daf019dfebd9cfae20aaab20fb0d33b2711ff857017",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "414"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:676cbae5ccc172b438eb5a0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是最常见的炸猪排吧。\\n好，来帮队伍里的所有人各做一份！",
      "source_fingerprint": "990f4ddd0e859226646a1f4eef62f8888bc21aa8823727a78af04d2b81601977",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "415"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7abbe7e17b21fba70a268cc3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会出赛的应该都是很猛的家伙吧……\\n一想到这里，我就期待到不行啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3b835210cf897e1269855f5d5790c92f68060dc24220c2066f8bef96a13172b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "416"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:909f48646df3981da32d0c15",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该是双脚的保养吧。为了不要让自己受伤，\\n我也从生野那里获得了很多建议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7703191ad3f1ceddf22b60b2b9c60d4fbfc20ccddf91c2dce61e82949768d1e2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "417"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bb898d195c087e49d791b74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "绝对不能失去冷静，要保持自己的步调。\\n多亏这样我才能在竞赛中顺利发挥出了实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5165a6dda06287c48cd2d4876cf196268466fc154d5c1d90566bff6eb60bafdf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "418"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3cc6960341758cf868e056e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是啊。不过我没有丝毫要退却的打算。\\n因为我会在准备万全且状态绝佳之下去挑战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6cd961f6f6065f6b8e6a943e65fab077ae718410f2071894bba435908ebde634",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "419"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcf4ea7912a64abe0c05d00d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "注重情绪吧。如果心生胆怯的话就无法\\n上场战斗。所以今天也要强悍地应战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24e276c541bfd986707d3042fe03207a3f5cda576e1bf029cbab78f54ffecbc3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "42"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89403568522d9cb305201205",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "No──！！唯独这件事，不管给我\\n多少墨西哥卷饼都还是No！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3f27bda8c972be85a520dcb7155ad364b8a85169ed93b4b3fc04b16239b85c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "420"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdcea8007f4eff84a0c4c988",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "神鹰我还没有拿出真本事！接下来还会\\n推出更加认真的表演给大家欣赏喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b002fa6484cd4c1fdc666cca12555fb8599b76080e8acef2aee1657f21907126",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "421"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:380141b82b46b3cefe2e2445",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哼哼哼～不过最热血的还是神鹰我的热情！\\n可要小心别被烫伤喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c73ce785b1bd59339fa14d3c39d58d2054da1e1e53f9a025fbcb51ada3de70a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "422"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:815ab75877d351b4ebff7467",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是由火腿、秋葵、乌龙面搭配在一起的\\n致胜料理「霸王」套餐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b408f537f13ac29d86ce4f4f24016c64ac1d9509a0f20ca068327e24f5b0dd01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "423"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cabf4f235d599cf3fdb71b01",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "就是要留意弹性速度以免过于单调这点。\\n然后将普契尼放在心中吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "116c02ba0aee2e916d6211bc1efa07ae19125bf58bba72c15ac319c57f1ec7cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "424"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff02473fadb7ecab2ec0f5b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看来大家都畏惧着我的才华！原谅我……\\n因为连我自己都无法抑制那份才华呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1da5ea9c319afa064068a03c0c748189adad8395479b094f628f19e72c1b9e23",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "425"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abce465a4780296ce8388ce3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "猛禽吗……挺不错的比喻。不管是我，\\n还是其他人，都只是为了生存而寻求着猎物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6633d98f105fa444a74ec16818358e084a47bb8adaf9ad8e155b8d5c1cb54daf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "426"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8fc2e0e18a8f72afa758daf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……说不期待是骗人的。不过，\\n无论对手是谁，我都一样会拿出全力去狩猎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6720f731e137f80affb146ced2de10d0df3b02f09362b1a89d8f9a2ba3c2ba78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "427"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8460238e3da27230914d0cf3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我不在乎。就依你们在看了我的表现之后\\n所感受到的那样，想怎么称呼我都行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e64a6ca03bf6e04cc643c5ae1a5c072755a11b0ed124545e7aeb59493cd3e86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "428"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b1b91e14c2f4b4aa64214bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "一阵清爽……激战结束之时可是风平浪静呢。\\n这就是所谓的暴风雨前的宁静吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a99555441d8b04abe19d85480252d9528449275684756971aad5f0824f960b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "429"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d1d2afff12e5fdaa1059a36",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今天因为脚的状况和干劲都很不错的关系，\\n所以我才能在竞赛中跑得非常开心♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2568ef5f13e75683c99526a66a8ac2dd83270928b3079fcda3202be902cbaa1e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "43"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
